Subdomain semantics of ||x^ versus exact entries, case folding, trailing
dots, IDNA entries, a whole-TLD rule and an IP entry.

-- list ads block adblock --
! Title: Conformance: adblock basics
! Last modified: 2026-10-11
[Adblock Plus 2.0]
||example.org^
|exact-anchor.example^
plain.example
||Mixed-Case.Example^
||trailing-dot.example.^
||bücher.example^
||xn--caf-dma.example^
||no-caret.example
||zip^
||1.2.3.4^
-- counts ads --
rules=10 exceptions=0 unsupported=0 invalid=0 ignored=0 entries=10
-- expect --
example.org                  block ads ||example.org^
www.example.org              block ads ||example.org^
a.b.c.example.org            block ads ||example.org^
EXAMPLE.ORG.                 block ads ||example.org^
Www.Example.Org              block ads ||example.org^
notexample.org               pass
example.org.evil.com         pass
example.organic              pass
org                          pass
exact-anchor.example         block ads |exact-anchor.example^
www.exact-anchor.example     pass    # |x^ is exact
plain.example                block ads plain.example
www.plain.example            pass    # plain domains are exact (spec: "but not its subdomains")
mixed-case.example           block ads ||mixed-case.example^
sub.MIXED-case.example       block ads ||mixed-case.example^
trailing-dot.example         block ads ||trailing-dot.example^
trailing-dot.example.        block ads ||trailing-dot.example^
xn--bcher-kva.example        block ads ||xn--bcher-kva.example^
www.xn--bcher-kva.example    block ads ||xn--bcher-kva.example^
xn--caf-dma.example          block ads ||xn--caf-dma.example^
no-caret.example             block ads ||no-caret.example^
x.no-caret.example           block ads ||no-caret.example^
no-caret.example.uk          pass    # deviation: ||x is read as ||x^ (no substring match)
whatever.zip                 block ads ||zip^
zip                          block ads ||zip^
zipper.example               pass
ip:1.2.3.4                   block ads 1.2.3.4
ip:1.2.3.5                   pass
1.2.3.4                      pass    # IP entries only match answer addresses
.                            pass
